TI  - Ecological bottlenecks and future pathways for Zygogramma bicolorata as a biocontrol agent of Parthenium hysterophorus in North India
AN  - 42255310
DO  - 10.3389/fpls.2026.1805750
VL  - 17
DA  - 2026
PY  - 2026
T2  - Frontiers in plant science
J2  - Front Plant Sci
